# Workspace Venv Sync

When adding dependencies to any repo's pyproject.toml, ALWAYS install at BOTH levels:

1. **Repo level**: `cd repo && uv pip install -e ".[dev]"`
2. **Workspace level**: `cd /Users/ikennaigboaka/Documents/Documents - Mac/repos/unified-trading-system-repos && source .venv-workspace/bin/activate && uv pip install package-name`

This ensures IDE health (Pylance, type checking) works across the workspace.

