## Execution Libraries (Renamed/New - Feb 2026)

**Rename:** `unified-order-interface` → `unified-trade-execution-interface`

**Install order** (dependency order for workspace venv IDE type hints):

```bash
cd /Users/ikennaigboaka/Documents/Documents - Mac/repos/unified-trading-system-repos
source .venv-workspace/bin/activate

# 1. matching-engine-library (no deps on other local libs)
uv pip install -e matching-engine-library

# 2. unified-trade-execution-interface (was unified-order-interface)
#    If version constraints fail: pip install -e unified-trade-execution-interface --no-deps
